// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2819738722" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Claw. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

