"P2605807170" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior lethal damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.   However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous lethal damage, as you impale your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. This power is needed for the Empower and Sweep combination attacks. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2757114495" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or Assassination. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. This power is the finishing move in the Empower combination attack. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1133349" "Your Empower combo improves your damage and To Hit for your next few attacks!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2739231675" "POWER UP!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Special 1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P684886009" "Vengeful Slice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3211390344" "Melee, High DMG(Lethal), Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P465859399" "Unleashes a series of strong attacks on your foe, dealing high lethal damage and knocking them down. This power is the finishing move for the Attack Vitals combination attack. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P640539268" "You knock {PlayerDest} off their feet with your {PowerName}"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2643030173" "Your Attack Vitals combo damages {PlayerDest} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1721490538" "{PlayerSource} lands an attack vitals combination for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P4015753434" "VITAL STRIKE!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Special 2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2381566568" "Sweeping Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1274017979" "Melee (Cone), Superior DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1201173186" "You make a sweeping strike with your blades, hitting all foes in a cone in front of you and dealing moderate lethal damage to each. This power is the opening move for the Weaken combination attack. Damage: Superior Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : High Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3331522538" "One Thousand Cuts"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4163818171" "Melee (Cone), Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P820439001" "Unleashes a flurry of attacks on all foes in a cone in front of you, dealing moderate lethal damage to each foe hit. This power is the finishing move for the Weaken combination attack. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2125517953" "-DEF, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3255797294" "Your chance to hit and Defenses have been reduced by the Weaken combo!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2427703288" "Your Weaken combo reduces {PlayerDest}'s chance to hit and Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3718531657" "Your chance to hit and Defenses have been reduced by {PlayerSource}'s Weaken combo!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P1397841337" "WEAKENED!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Electrical Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1391540274" "Electrical Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1527438593" "Electricity surges through your body and you can channel this electricity through your fists. Electrical Melee allows you to pummel your foes with various melee attack powers while jolting them with a powerful electric current.  Electric Melee powers can drain foes' Endurance and temporarily halt their Endurance recovery.  Some powers may even return a portion of drained Endurance back to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Charged Brawl 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P347968085" "Charged Brawl"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1147823905" "Melee, Minor DMG(Smash/Energy), Target Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P723334531" "Your fists become electrically charged and deliver a powerful punch. Charged Brawl can drain some Endurance from the target and may overload their synapses, leaving them writhing for a moment.  A portion of drained Endurance may be returned to you.  Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release him. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3472027048" "Sleep"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P214558273" "You are in shock from the Charged Brawl attack and cannot move."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2658325911" "Your {PowerName} smashes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P135684187" "{PlayerSource} smashes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P509105884" "Your {PowerName} smashes {PlayerDest} for an additional {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P132682522" "{PlayerSource} smashes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3572091661" "You land a critical hit on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1053135465" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P391491014" "Your {PowerName} has put {PlayerDest} to sleep!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1000888170" "{PlayerSource} has put you to sleep with their {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2154700027" "Your {PowerName} drains some endurance from {PlayerDest}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P456748222" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} and drains some of your Endurance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1051884142" "You recover some of the Endurance you drained."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Havoc Punch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P632018255" "Havoc Punch"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P803438448" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P723120656" "The Havoc Punch is a slower attack than Charged Brawl, but makes up for it with a greater damage. Havoc Punch can drain some Endurance from your target and may overload their synapses, leaving them writhing for a moment.  A portion of the drained Endurance may be given back to you.  Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release him. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1984746263" "You are in shock from the Havok Punch attack and cannot move."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P860170444" "You smash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1083611728" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2384625231" "You smash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for an additional {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1226085207" "{PlayerSource} shocks you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Jacobs Ladder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3434029265" "Jacobs Ladder"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P748724187" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Energy), Foe Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3927381099" "You are able to generate a strong current between your arms and snap a powerful bolt of electricity in an arc in front of you.  This melee attack can electrocute all foes within the arc dealing High energy damage.  Jacobs Ladder can drain some Endurance from your target and may overload their synapses, leaving them writhing for a moment. Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release him. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3791695392" "You are in shock from the Jacobs Ladder attack and cannot move."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1378266986" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3689291402" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3425032517" "Assassin's Shock"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3033521343" "Melee, Special DMG(Smashing, Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4118100759" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior energy and smashing damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P923730252" "Your {PowerName} waylays {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1299301238" "{PlayerSource} waylays you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2658009478" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Strike. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chain Induction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1045457615" "Chain Induction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2980306831" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Foe -End +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P494015943" "This Electric Melee attack deals moderate Smashing and Energy damage and may drain some of the targets Endurance. However, this attack also induces an unstable electric charge that may jump to another enemy target.  The charge will jump to the closest enemy in range that has not been previously hit, until it inevitably dissipates. Enhancements will boost the effectiveness of the initial attack as well as the jumping charge. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1988226113" "Charged"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1494527800" "You still carry a charge leftover from the Chain Induction punch.  You may accidentally release this charge and zap a nearby ally."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2946783966" "{PlayerSource} bashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Clap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1363030893" "Thunder Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2738002854" "Melee (AoE), High DMG(Smash, Energy), Foe Disorient, Knockback, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1320744260" "A massive attack. You smash your foes with all the power of a lightning bolt. The pummeled victim takes tremendous damage and may be Disoriented. Any nearby foes may be knocked down and take some damage from the shockwave as well as have some endurance drained. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2848422893" "Disorient"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2366756416" "You have been Disoriented."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1393763693" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of smashing Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3130787388" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2330141365" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest} and drains some of their endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P741266314" "The explosion from {PlayerSource}'s Thunder Strike blasts you for {Damage} points of energy damage and drains some of your endurance!""
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1747316234" "You land a critical hit on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2063811541" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P713892034" "You disorient {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3202947871" "{PlayerSource} disorients you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lightning Rod 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775656620" "Lightning Rod"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P482008978" "PBAoE Superior DMG(Energy), Foe Knockback; Self Teleport;"
// Power Help Text :
"P4260412265" "You can polarize your body and become a living Lightning Rod. This power calls forth a massive lightning bolt from the sky to strike you. You can then ride this bolt and instantly Teleport a short distance. You rematerialize in a massive bolt of electricity, dealing massive damage and knocking down all nearby foes. Damage from the lightning bolt is superior. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
