// Display Name :
"P2674318123" "Energy Transfer"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P178226163" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Disorient, Self -HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P3258976059" "Mastery of Energy Melee begins with the ability to transfer your own Hit Points into a punch that deals extreme smashing and energy damage. Energy Transfer has a good chance of Disorienting the target. Unlike other Stalker primary attack powers, Energy Transfer cannot land a Critical hit.  However, if this attack is executed successfully while Hidden, you can avoid the Hit Point loss to yourself and deal a massive blow with no penalty. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2325826284" "You concentrate and overload your energy into your {PowerName}.  You pummel {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2725662583" "You concentration falters, which causes {Damage} points of energy damage to you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Total Focus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P479970076" "Total Focus"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3079084185" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P575040622" "Total Focus is complete mastery over Energy Melee. This is a very slow, but incredibly devastating smashing and energy attack that can knock out most opponents, leaving them Disoriented. Due to the exhausting nature of Total Focus, recharge time is very long. A Critical hit with Total Focus deals extra damage, but not double. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P951999692" "The devastation of your {PowerName} deals a whopping {Damage} points of smashing Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P503314699" "The devastation of your {PowerName} deals an additional whopping {Damage} points of energy Damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2802152503" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of energy damage!"

