"P733897618" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3303981423" "You can unleash a roundhouse kick that pummels your foe for moderate damage. Storm Kick has a greater then average chance to score a critical hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Medium"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1516596182" "You pummel {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P706943917" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crippling Axe Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P564166934" "Crippling Axe Kick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P485369266" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smashing), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Fly, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P4198082174" "You can perform a Crippling Axe Kick that deals moderate smashing damage, reduces the targets defense, may Immobilize, and Slowing their run speed. Crippling Axe Kick may also knock some flying entities out of the sky. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3459848461" "Immobilize, -SPD, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2030877144" "The Crippling Axe Kick has crippled you, reducing your defense.  You are immobilized and your Running speed will be reduced once you can move again."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3202008795" "Your strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slow their movement speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2222991335" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and slows your movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2496147428" "You immobilize {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1351624918" "{PlayerSource} immobilize you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3551718562" "Assassin's Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P610244141" "Melee, Special DMG(Smashing)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4137054930" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior smashing damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focus Chi 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1445800149" "Focus Chi"
// Power Help Text :
"P2585448142" "Tapping into your inner Chi greatly increases the amount of damage you deal for a few seconds, as well as slightly increasing your chance to hit.  Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3982791932" "You tap into your inner chi with your {PowerName} and are more  accurate and more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
