// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2618745955" "Cobra Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1983949940" "Melee, Medium DMG(Smashing), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P702006943" "Using intense martial arts focus, you can perform a Cobra Strike that deals minor damage, but has a great chance of Disorienting your target. Damage: Medium, Recharge: Medium"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crane Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2311173841" "Crane Kick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3309440621" "Melee, High DMG(Smashing), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1820988499" "You can perform a slow, high smashing damage kick that will likely knock your target back. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eagles Claw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2733210193" "Eagles Claw"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1454154932" "Melee, Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor Disorient, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2090001082" "You can perform a devastating smashing damage kick that can severely Disorient most opponents. Eagle's Claw has an exceptionally good critical hit capability.  In addition to the normal Critical from attacking while Hidden, there is also a small chance you may land a Critical hit even if you are not Hidden. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1900078763" "You deal {PlayerDest} a critical blow with your {PowerName} for an additional {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3619883057" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a critical blow from their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninja Sword 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P456380780" "Ninja Blade"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2946740511" "Wield a Ninja Blade and master a variety of powerful Lethal attacks. A quick and elegant weapon, the Ninja Blade can reduce an enemy's Defense. The Ninja Blade is a fine blade that always has a bonus to Accuracy. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Ninja Blade attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P482956191" "Sting of the Wasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1618948428" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P4262964925" "You perform a standard attack with your Ninja Blade. This attack is slower than Gambler's Cut, but deals more lethal damage. Sting of the Wasp can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2982196974" "The Ninja Blade has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1096584021" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3467335787" "{PlayerSource} hits you with {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P412215465" "Gambler's Cut"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1405577400" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P2867342087" "You perform a quick slash with your Ninja Blade. This attack is very fast, but deals only minor lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P535707029" "Flashing Steel"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2101973492" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P515391207" "You swing your Ninja Blade in a wide arc in front of you, slicing multiple foes with lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical for extra damage.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

