// Power : Assassin's Blade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3164628714" "Assassin's Blade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3318818798" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Blade. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Parry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1110037938" "Divine Avalanche"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P869241214" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), Self +DEF (Melee, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4178460927" "You can use your Ninja Blade to parry incoming melee attacks and then quickly return the favor. Divine Avalanche does minor damage, but every successful hit will increase your Defense against melee and lethal attacks for a short while. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3564503680" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage, and your {PowerName} increases your defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3987798505" "{PlayerSource} hits you with {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and increases their defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disembowel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2342337324" "Soaring Dragon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2714891084" "Melee, Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockup, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P32066094" "You perform a powerful Soaring Dragon maneuver that deals a great amount of lethal damage, and can knock a target up into the air. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Head Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2240630470" "Golden Dragonfly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2818835782" "You perform a devastating Golden Dragonfly attack that deals a massive amount of lethal damage and can even knock a foe down to the ground and reduce their Defense. The power of this attack can actually extend a short distance through multiple foes. If executed while hidden, only some affected targets may be hit with a Critical, however, there is a chance you may land a Critical hit with Golden Dragonfly even if you are not Hidden.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Psionic Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1890370791" "Psionic Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1231712572" "You are able to strike at foes with psychic projections including deadly psi blades. Psionic Melee provides excellent crowd control by dominating the minds of its victims. Your psionic damaging attacks have a chance to grant you Insight into your enemies. While you have Insight, your psionic damage powers cause additional psionic damage over time and your Boggle and Psi Blade Sweep powers become more potent."
// SetAccountTooltip :
"P259518364" "Please purchase this powerset in the Paragon Market to gain access to this feature."

