"P2838202683" "Melee, Light DMG(Psionic/Smash), Foe -Rech; Self +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P348588553" "You project psionic energy around your fist and strike at your foe dealing light Psionic and Smashing damage. Affected foes will have their recharge rate reduced. Mental Strike has a small chance to grant you Insight. While you have Insight, Mental Strike will deal additional minor psionic damage over time. Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
