"P4157163835" "Boggle"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3125615589" "Short Ranged, Target Confuse, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3058633333" "You flood your foe's mind with doubt causing them to become confused for a brief time. Confused foes will attack their allies.  Boggle will also place the "Boggled" effect on your target for a short time.  Attacking a Boggled target will increase your chance of gaining Insight.  Recharge: Long"
