"P653056153" "Insight Strike!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416744077" "You hold {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P558192329" "{PlayerSource} holds you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mass Levitate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2337009411" "Mass Levitate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2948948823" "PBAoE, High DMG(Smash), Foe Knock Up, +Insight"
// Power Help Text :
"P1524408246" "You build up a large amount of telekinetic energy and release it causing nearby foes to be flung into the air. Affected foes will suffer high Smashing damage. If the caster has Insight when this power is used Mass Levitate will also cause a moderate amount of Psionic damage over time. Damage: High, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3352584451" "You {PowerName} {PlayerDest} and drop them to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3443579566" "{PlayerSource} lifts you and drops you to the ground for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Radiation Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P410887822" "Radiation Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1053000728" "You are able to harness the power of Radiation to crush your foes in close quarters. Radiation Melee attacks have a chance to inflict the Contaminated state on a target for a moderate amount of time. Powers that deal greater damage, have a longer recharge time and animation time have a greater chance to inflict Contaminated. Hitting Contaminated targets with Contaminated Strike, Radioactive Smash, Radiation Siphon and Devastating Blow cause a portion of that power's damage to also hit nearby foes. Radiation Melee attacks primarily deal smashing and energy damage, but this set is also capable of dealing some toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Contaminated Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3425316208" "Contaminated Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P935921029" "Melee, Light DMG(Energy/Smash), Foe -Def, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2055256489" "You charge your fist with harmful radioactive particles and quickly strike your foe dealing Light Energy and Smashing damage as well as reducing their defense. Affected enemies have a small chance to be affected by the Contaminated effect. Hitting Contaminated foes with single target Radiation Melee powers cause a small burst of damage to foes near the target. Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
