// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1204045149" "{PlayerSource} causes you to bleed for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2483219626" "{PlayerSource} critically hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
