"P898882958" "Maiming Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1225047501" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), Minor DoT(Lethal), Foe -Speed, +1 Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1668301217" "You execute a savage slash at your foe's lower body causing moderate lethal damage and minor damage over time. The foe will also have their movement speed reduced moderately. Maiming Slash grants 1 stack of Blood Frenzy. Damage: Moderate, Minor DoT, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2234167941" "-Speed, Minor DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1142840062" "Your movement speed has been reduced and you are bleeding!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P269414318" "You slash at {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their movement speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1912862879" "{PlayerSource} slashes at your with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reduces your movement speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Shred 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1109597047" "Shred"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1204705949" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), -Def(All), Self -Blood Frenzy +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3241233476" "You rapidly slash at your foes several times causing a moderate amount of damage to all enemies in front of you and reduce their defense. Shred also causes minor lethal damage over time. This power consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy and will deal slightly more damage per stack. Additionally, Shred has a 20% chance to immediately recharge itself for each stack of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Damage: Moderate, Minor DoT, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P396928226" "-Def, Minor DoT(Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2288190983" "Your defense has been reduced and you are bleeding."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4210179658" "You slash at {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage and reduce their defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2903778642" "{PlayerSource} slashes at your with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage and reduces  your defense!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2432555977" "You are exhausted from using the {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P4236885904" "Exhausted!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Frenzy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2958490367" "Assassin's Frenzy"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2424382537" "Melee, Special DMG(Lethal), +Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P2570230068" "A signature Stalker attack. This attack does superior lethal damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted. However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden. Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. Using Assassin's Frenzy will grant 2 stacks of Blood Frenzy if used while not hidden and will grant 3 stacks if hidden. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not. Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blood Thirst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3105194080" "Blood Thirst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3966551164" "Self, +HP, +Health over Time, -Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P3560761146" "You focus for a moment and clear your head to take a moment to recover from your wounds. Blood Thirst will immediately heal you for a small amount and cause you to heal for a moderate amount of health over a short time seconds. Blood Thirst consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy. This power's heal over time effect grows with each stack of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time, but the duration of the heal over time effect is increased. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3830855541" "You take a moment to clear  your head and recover from your wounds."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1264138763" "Healing over Time"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2045207445" "You are recovering health over time due to your Blood Thirst."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hemorrhage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P723020678" "Hemorrhage"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2181602443" "Melee, Light DMG(Lethal), Foe Special DoT(Lethal), -Blood Frenzy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1346462429" "You viciously tear at your foe causing a light amount of lethal damage. Additionally, the target will suffer from lethal damage over time. Hemorrhage consumes all stacks of Blood Frenzy. This power's damage over time effect will scale with the number of stacks of Blood Frenzy. Using this power with 5 stacks of Blood Frenzy causes you to become Exhausted for a short time, but the duration of Hemorrhage's damage over time effect is increased. While exhausted you cannot gain Blood Frenzy. Damage: High, Special DoT, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1433672180" "Heavy DoT(Lethal)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Savage Leap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1339193839" "Savage Leap"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P615360225" "PBAoE, Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Minor DoT(Lethal), +3 Blood Frenzy, Self Teleport"
// Power Help Text :
"P1921002539" "You throw yourself at your distant foes while slashing and tearing wildly dealing superior lethal damage and causing your foes to suffer from additional minor lethal damage over time. Savage Leap build 3 stacks of Blood Frenzy. Damage: Superior, Minor DoT, Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P994619628" "You gain 3 stacks of Blood Frenzy!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Spines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P401332978" "Spines"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1457756702" "Spines protrude from your body and can deal damage in melee or at very short ranges. Spines are hollow and hold a neural toxin that deals additional Toxic damage and can Slow or Immobilize your enemies. The toxin is cumulative, and multiple hits will affect a target more strongly.  Very few foes have resistance to Spine poison. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Spine attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Barb Swipe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P462935467" "Barb Swipe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P229338810" "Melee, Light DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3989322711" "Shred your opponent with several quick Swipes from your Spines. Barb Swipe deals Light Lethal damage and a minor amount of additional Toxic damage over time and Slows affected foes. Damage: Light, Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P460077861" "DoT(Toxic), -Recharge, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1898299666" "You are poisoned!  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P75877681" "{PlayerSource} shreds you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3872693350" "Poison from your Spines deal {damage} points of Toxic damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2056617940" "You take {Damage} points of Toxic damage from {PlayerSource}'s Spines!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lunge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1391303782" "Lunge"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P988536732" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic) -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3273227640" "You Lunge forward, stabbing and poisoning a foe with the large Spine on your arm. Lunge deals moderate lethal damage. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3655665276" "Your {PowerName} stabs {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1036155177" "{PlayerSource} stabs you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spine Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3989574906" "Spine Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2583689436" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3659393835" "You can fling dozens of Spines in all directions. These Spines only travel a short distance, but they can deal moderate lethal damage and poison any target close to you. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical Hit for extra damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1245101035" "You Fling your quills all around you and impale {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Impaler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1271663734" "Assassin's Impaler"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3135706759" "Your {PowerName} impales {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1301113522" "{PlayerSource} impale you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2304939764" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Impaler. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Impale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P781056268" "Impale"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1567815020" "Ranged, High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P397596102" "You can throw a single large Spine at a targeted foe. This Spine does only moderate lethal damage, but carries a large amount of the Spine toxin. A successful attack can completely Immobilize most foes, as well as Slowing them and dealing Toxic poison damage. Impale can also bring down flying entities. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3019835266" "DoT(Toxic), Immobilize, -SPD, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1905845750" "You are poisoned!  Your Running speed is reduced and you may be immobilized and unable to fly."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3671954593" "You Impale {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ripper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4259928669" "Ripper"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3235467969" "Melee (Cone), High DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), Knockback, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1885387076" "You can unleash a spectacular slashing maneuver that attacks all foes in a wide arc in front of you. Ripper deals massive lethal damage and poisons multiple targets. It can even knock foes down. Spine poison Slows affected targets and deals additional Toxic damage. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical Hit for extra damage.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2484326134" "You slash {PlayerDest} with your mighty {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2966356888" "{PlayerSource} slashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Throw Spines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P282595829" "Throw Spines"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3785176780" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P160539514" "You can throw dozens of Spines in a wide cone in front of you, impaling foes caught within the range. Spine throwing deals moderate lethal damage, and poisons any targets it hits. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical Hit for extra damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2571351405" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Brawling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2938953140" "Street Justice"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3810110994" "Street Justice delivers punishing bone crushing attacks that weaken, disable or otherwise hinder their foes. This melee power set has no singular form of secondary effect. Instead, it has many ways to cripple enemies. Street Justice's attack powers come in two categories: Combo Builders and Finishers. Combo Builders add to your Combo Level and thus empower any Finishers you use. See individual powers for how they're improved by Combo Level.  Combo Building powers can provide up to 3 levels of benefits. Build up to the third level before executing a Finisher for maximum effectiveness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Initial Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2767938832" "Initial Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4236187729" "Melee, Light DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P2369376472" "You deliver a pair of lightning fast blows to your opponent in an effort to throw them off balance. Initial Strike deals Light Smashing damage and has a small chance to disorient your target. Initial Strike is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P580006646" "Your {PowerName} hits {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3886663292" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P23959295" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3602669381" "You boost your combo level to 1!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4254141574" "You boost your combo level to 2!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3834265031" "You boost your combo level to 3!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heavy Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1523772661" "Heavy Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3368222246" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P3737800714" "You strike your foe with a powerful punch dealing Moderate Smashing damage. Heavy Blow has a fair chance to knock the target off its feet.  Heavy Blow is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1414460940" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P329706590" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with a {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3816816025" "You knocked {PlayerDest} from their feet!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4218578531" "{PlayerSource} knocks you from your feet!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sweeping Cross 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P109148076" "Sweeping Cross"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2859779456" "Melee (Cone), High DMG (Smash), Foe Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4037957082" "You execute a sweeping right hook that can strike multiple targets in your frontal arc. Sweeping Cross deals High Smashing damage and can disorient foes. Sweeping Cross is a Finisher and sets your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to disorient dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Sweeping Cross will also have a chance to knock down the affected targets. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3526780053" "Melee, Special DMG (Smash), Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P4188223355" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior smashing damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus.  Assassin's Strike builds 2 Combo Levels. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spinning Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4288055952" "Spinning Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1836111938" "Melee (Targeted AoE), Heavy DMG (Smash), Foe Knockdown, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P4199344975" "You execute a spinning attack that first strikes with your fist and finally your heel hitting your foe and all enemies immediately nearby. Spinning Strike deals Heavy Smashing damage and has a high chance to knockdown foes. Spinning Strike is a Finisher and sets  your current Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a greater chance to knockdown dependent upon the current Combo Level. At Combo Level 3, Spinning Strike also has a moderate chance to briefly inflict Terrorize in nearby foes. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P419999198" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3744035969" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2073040866" "You strike fear into {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2094263606" "{PlayerSource} strikes fear into you with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Low Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1060578758" "Shin Breaker"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4142953630" "Melee, Superior DMG (Smash), Foe -Speed, -Defense, Combo Builder"
// Power Help Text :
"P842572428" "You execute a quick but powerful kick targeting your foe's leg in an attempt to cripple their movement. Shin Breaker deals Superior Smashing damage and moderately reduces your target's movement speed and defense for a short time. Shin Breaker is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level.  Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1900140634" "-SPD, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3556295630" "The Shin Breaker has reduced your movement speed as well as your defense."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1362971409" "Your strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing their movement rate and reducing their defenses!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P984764953" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing your movement speed and reducing your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Uppercut 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1268394429" "Crushing Uppercut"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P58316216" "Melee, Extreme DMG (Smash), Foe Knock Up, Disorient, Finisher"
// Power Help Text :
"P2636377119" "You perform a jaw breaking Crushing Uppercut on your target inflicting Extreme Smashing damage and knocking them into the air.  Crushing Uppercut will leave the target disoriented for a short time.  Crushing Uppercut is a Finisher and will set your Combo Level to 0.  It will deal additional damage and have a longer disorient duration dependent upon the current Combo level. At Combo Level 3, Crushing Uppercut will have its disorient effect upgraded to a Hold effect. Critical damage is unaffected by your Combo Level.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P505982803" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Staff Fighting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1671348127" "Staff Fighting"
// DisplayHelp :
"P239449990" "You have mastered the art of staff fighting, allowing you to strike at your foes in great sweeping arcs.  Staff Fighting provides a good amount of control effects as well as some self buffs.  Your melee attacks build stacks of Perfection of Body.  Once you have three stacks of this power using Eye of the Storm or Sky Splitter will result in a more powerful effect and will consume all 3 stacks of Perfection of Body."

