"P974119330" "Melee, Light DMG(Smash), Foe -Def"
// Power Help Text :
"P111496036" "You strike your foe with a lightning fast blow from  your staff dealing Light Smashing damage.  The attack is so unexpected  that the target's defenses are reduced slightly for a short time.  This power grants one stack of Perfection of Body. Damage: Light, Recharge: Fast"
