"P3627445229" "Your defense has been reduced by Mercurial Blow."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1893956116" "You strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce their defense."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3682586936" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"
