"P1562137608" "Precise Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2562606845" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P555077817" "You attempt to daze your foe with a heavy staff blow  to their head.  Precise Strike has a higher chance to hit than normal,  deals Moderate Smashing damage, and has a small chance to disorient the  target briefly. This power grants one stack of Perfection of Body. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast."
