"P4190696096" "Melee, Special DMG(Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4180238003" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior smashing damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. This power grants one stack of Perfection of Body. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4055420882" "Your {PowerName} bashes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1470751021" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1841485248" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassin's Staff. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eye of the Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1480912102" "Eye of the Storm"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3417303276" "PBAoE Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Knockdown, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P2325289130" "With a lightning fast series of spins of your staff you strike at all nearby foes dealing moderate damage with a chance of knocking foes down.  This power will build one stack of Perfection of Body if the user has two or less stacks, if the user has three stacks of Perfection of Body it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 stacks of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and reduce damage resistance slightly for a short time. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3450006853" "-Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3151999223" "Eye of the Storm has reduced your resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P292151044" "{PlayerSource} strikes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1388680925" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional smashing damage and reducing the target's damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1118979355" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional points of smashing damage and reducing your damage resistance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Serpents Reach 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3729913855" "Serpent's Reach"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2726034528" "Ranged, High Dmg(Smash), Foe Knockdown"
// Power Help Text :
"P3927687407" "You fully extend your staff and release a burst of energy to lash out at a distant target and deal High Smashing damage with a good chance to knock your target down.  This power builds one level of Perfection of Body.  Damage: High, Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sky Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P110753208" "Sky Splitter"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2379474523" "Melee, Extreme DMG(Smash), Foe Knock Up, Disorient, -Fly, Consumes Perfection"
// Power Help Text :
"P1875151806" "You leap into the air and hammer your foe with an overhead bash from your staff.  Sky Splitter deals Extreme Smashing damage, will knock the target into the air and will briefly disorient your target. This power will build one stack of Perfection of Body if the user has two or less stacks, if the user has three stacks of Perfection of Body it will consume them and gain some benefit.  3 Levels of Perfection of Body will cause additional smashing damage and grant the user a bonus to damage resistance a short time.  Critical Hit damage isn't enhanced by levels of Perfection.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1767117015" "You decimate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P79296238" "{PlayerSource} decimates you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4041673568" "{PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional smashing damage and boosting your damage resistance!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P905210279" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} is infused with Perfection of Body causing {Damage} additional points of smashing damage and reducing their damage resistance!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1662970345" "Your {PowerName} drops {PlayerDest} from the skies."
